    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Grill\u2019d: The Vanishing] is a mystery dinner party detective game experienced through a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bc655ad62e464ccc6912a08c99d7cb6b.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a royal investigator, you find yourself locked in the manor of a fallen noble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/b7b402b79aa63805762610ec65107571.avif?t=1752568938\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all exits sealed, you soon realize that something or someone vanishes every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the traces of missing things to uncover the manor's hidden truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/e5261ac19496950d996c256ece1488ff.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bafed12cab18f2c086b5fb44ed8a328b.poster.avif?t=1752568938\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bafed12cab18f2c086b5fb44ed8a328b.webm?t=1752568938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bafed12cab18f2c086b5fb44ed8a328b.mp4?t=1752568938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover clues, think about their relationships, <strong>and make connections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each connection reveals new evidence, bringing you closer to the hidden truth behind the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/4ce4aff137743c4e839f744a1aa97e3f.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every evening at dinner time, everyone gathers in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dine with others, engage in conversation, and cast suspicion on one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/7c9560e90474688a99c56f084a23cd78.poster.avif?t=1752568938\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/7c9560e90474688a99c56f084a23cd78.webm?t=1752568938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/7c9560e90474688a99c56f084a23cd78.mp4?t=1752568938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully\u2014the line between truth and lies will be revealed at this feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/b1953f65862e41ae148d68297564a7a1.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been granted special authority by the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this manor, where neither police nor judge exist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>only you possess the power to judge the suspects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/ca8c334f4bd01f8b66c671cd7cd12739.poster.avif?t=1752568938\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/ca8c334f4bd01f8b66c671cd7cd12739.webm?t=1752568938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/ca8c334f4bd01f8b66c671cd7cd12739.mp4?t=1752568938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop out the hidden contradictions in their statements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >poke at their lies until every deception is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn away every lie until only the truth remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8817c360719164cc049c4cf914712781.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As food runs low, fear takes hold, suspicion grows\u2014and people vanish one by one\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover every hidden secret and safely escape the manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Grill\u2019d: The Vanishing] is a mystery dinner party detective game experienced through a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bc655ad62e464ccc6912a08c99d7cb6b.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a royal investigator, you find yourself locked in the manor of a fallen noble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/b7b402b79aa63805762610ec65107571.avif?t=1752568938\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all exits sealed, you soon realize that something or someone vanishes every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the traces of missing things to uncover the manor's hidden truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/e5261ac19496950d996c256ece1488ff.webp?t=1752568938\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bafed12cab18f2c086b5fb44ed8a328b.poster.avif?t=1752568938\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/bafed12cab18f2c086b5fb44ed8a328b.we